         <calendarDesc>
            <calendar xml:id="Pahlavi">
               <p>Post-Yazdgird era (PY)</p>
            </calendar>
            <calendar xml:id="Julian">
               <p>Julian calendar (CE)</p>
            </calendar>
         </calendarDesc>
         <particDesc>
            <p>A person called <persName ref="people:CIr009">Dādēnwindād</persName> distributes fodder for donkeys.</p>
            <p>The date of the transaction is day Māh of the month Wahman of the year 40 PY, equivalent to 16 April 692 CE.</p>
            <p>The document is sealed by the <persName ref="people:CIr010" type="seal">ōstāndār</persName>.</p>
         </particDesc>
         <settingDesc>
            <p>Locations mentioned in this document are <placeName>Yazdān-ābestān</placeName>, <placeName>Namēwar</placeName>, <placeName>Dalīgān</placeName>, and <placeName>Paywēr</placeName>.</p>
         </settingDesc>
         <creation>
            <date when="0040-11-12" calendar="#Pahlavi">Day Māh, Month Wahman, 40 PY</date>
            <date when="0692-04-16" calendar="#Julian">16 April 692 CE</date>
         </creation>
      </profileDesc>
   </teiHeader>
   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85298-80.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0085_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/><persName ref="people:CIr009">dʾṭynwndʾṭˈ</persName> Y PWN
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/><placeName>yẕdʾnʾpstʾn</placeName> dʾlyk MN ẔK
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>Y ʿL bwnˈ ẔNH BYRḤ
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>whwmnˈ Y ŠNṬ M
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>W YWM mʾh ḤMR&gt;
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>III-III Y MN <placeName>nmywl</placeName>
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>W <placeName>dlykʾn</placeName> MN nhwmkˈ(?)
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>pwd CL <placeName>p(ʾ)ṭwyl</placeName>
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>(ḤYṬYWNtny ?) Iʾd ŠG
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>K-#III-III ʿL hlbndkʾn
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>Y ẔK ḤMRʾn YḤBWNṭˈ
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trl-p1-l12"/><persName ref="people:CIr010" type="seal">ʾwsṭʾndʾl</persName> ḤTYMWNt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0085_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/><persName ref="people:CIr009">Dādēnwindād</persName> ī pad
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/><placeName>Yazdān-ābestān</placeName> dārīg az ān
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>ī ō bun ēn māh
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>Wahman ī sāl 40
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>ud rōz Māh xar
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>6 ī az <placeName>Namēwar</placeName>
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>ud <placeName>Dalīgān</placeName> az nohomak(?)
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>pōy ō <placeName>Paywēr</placeName>
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>(ōnīdan ?) rāy ǰaw
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>k(abīz) 6 ō xar-bandagān
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>ī ān xarān dād
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/><persName ref="people:CIr010" type="seal">ōstāndār</persName> āwist
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0085_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1-2" xml:id="trans-p1-l1-2"/><persName>Dādēnwindād</persName>, the manager in Yazdān-ābestān: from
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>what (belongs) to the bun, this month
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>Wahman (11th month) of the year 40
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>and day Māh (12th day), regarding (ray, line 9) 6 donkeys,
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>that (have to be brought?) from Namēwar
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>and Dalīgān, (for the distance) from the “ninth
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>station” (?) to Paywēr,
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>barley
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>6 kabīz to the donkey drivers
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trans-p1-l11"/>of these donkeys given.
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trans-p1-l12"/>The ōstāndār sealed.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>